#. Description of the plugin
#: brocode-consent-embed.php
msgid "Click-to-load embeds for Google Maps, Google Calendar, YouTube, Vimeo and OpenStreetMap. Nothing is loaded from the third party until the visitor consents. Also gates existing YouTube and Vimeo embeds, and honours the WP Consent API."
msgstr ""

